  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.10.0 - Viewers. DiffView.FromUnifiedDiff shows a unified diff from git, a review API, or a patch file, with file and hunk headers and metadata (new DiffLineKind members), the files it covers with ] and [ navigation, a line-number gutter, search with F3, viewport paging, PlainText, and theme styles; hunk extents come from the @@ counts, quoted paths are unquoted, and malformed input renders literally. HeatMap gains an opt-in keyboard and mouse selection, discrete levels with their own glyphs and styles, a legend, wide cells, labels that span columns, cell descriptions as tooltips or a footer, selectable-cell and navigation hooks, and theme styles. The new CalendarHeatMap is a contribution calendar with month and weekday labels, day and week navigation, a legend, and a day description. Additive; the few visible changes are listed under Changed. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
